  greetings:
  - Detective. Heard you were in town.
  - Evening. Wipe your boots.
  aboutSelf: Fix engines, grow sorghum, mind my own business.
  aboutTown: People here are what they are. Ain't no shame in it.
  seenAnythingStrange: Our family photo from '79. I'm blurry in it. I never move in photos. Never.
  foundersDay: Rained. Mae won. Cherry. My boy threw up on the hayride.
  gossip:
  - title: About Greta Kessler
    response: Greta's got a scar on her left cheek from a heifer. Don't ask her about it.
  - title: About Wendell Dobbs
    response: Wendell's right eye went milky last winter. Says it lets him see what the other one can't.
  - title: About Bev Thorne
    response: Bev's got a mole on her right cheek. I call it her beauty spot. She calls it a mole.
